//! Generated entity-type id->name tables for protocol 5 (Minecraft 1.7.6-1.7.10).
//!
//! Protocol 5 numbers mobs and objects in two **separate** id spaces, so these
//! are two independent tables and an id means nothing without knowing which
//! spawn packet carried it. Consumed by [`crate::entity_types`].
//!
//! Unlike the 1.8 era's equivalent, these tables are generated from a wire
//! transcript rather than from `minecraft-data`, and the dataset is the
//! cross-check rather than the source. `tests/entity_types.rs` records what
//! that comparison found.

